<p>Using both your mind and your arms you propel your two handed weapon to deal a huge strike doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">151%, 164%, 174%, 182%, 190%</acronym> weapon mind damage.</p><p>If the blow connects and the target fails a mental save there is <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">37%, 44%, 51%, 58%, 65%</acronym> chance that the blow was so powerful it ripped a psychic imprint off the target.</p><p>It will appear nearby and serve you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>If you do not have a two handed weapon equiped, but have it in your off set, you instantly automatically switch.</p>